 },
 "html": "<h2 id=\"secao-1-1\">1.1 Bibliotecas</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> importa as bibliotecas usadas no fluxo de análise.</p>\n<div aria-label=\"O que faz:\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Biblioteca</th>\n<th>Papel</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pandas</code></td>\n<td>leitura, limpeza, transformação e agregação de tabelas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>numpy</code></td>\n<td>operações numéricas, arrays, funções matemáticas (<code>log</code>, <code>where</code>, ...)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>matplotlib</code></td>\n<td>base de todos os gráficos (figura, eixos, títulos, salvar)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>seaborn</code></td>\n<td>gráficos estatísticos de alto nível sobre o matplotlib</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scipy.stats</code></td>\n<td>estatística descritiva avançada, correlação, testes de hipóteses, regressão simples</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>statistics</code></td>\n<td>variância e desvio padrão amostral/populacional explícitos</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>statsmodels</code></td>\n<td>Tukey, teste Z, teste de proporções, poder e tamanho de amostra, regressão OLS completa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sqlite3</code> <em>(biblioteca padrão)</em></td>\n<td>banco de dados SQL local para praticar e executar consultas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pingouin</code> <em>(opcional)</em></td>\n<td>testes com tabela completa: efeito, IC, poder, Welch, Games-Howell</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scikit_posthocs</code> <em>(opcional)</em></td>\n<td>teste de Dunn (pós-teste não paramétrico)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Instalação (rodar uma vez, apenas se faltar algum pacote)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># !pip install pandas numpy matplotlib seaborn scipy statsmodels pingouin scikit-posthocs openpyxl</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> statistics <span class=\"tk-kw\">as</span> st</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">from</span> pathlib <span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> Path</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> matplotlib.pyplot <span class=\"tk-kw\">as</span> plt</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> numpy <span class=\"tk-kw\">as</span> np</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"tk-kw\">as</span> pd</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> seaborn <span class=\"tk-kw\">as</span> sns</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">from</span> scipy <span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> stats</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">%<span class=\"tk-kw\">matplotlib</span> inline</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-1-2\">1.2 Opções de exibição e estilo dos gráficos</h2>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> sempre no início. Isso evita que o pandas esconda colunas e padroniza a aparência dos gráficos.</p>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li><code>display.max_rows = None</code> em tabelas grandes pode travar o notebook. Prefira um número (ex.: <code>100</code>).</li>\n<li><code>float_format</code> muda apenas a <strong>exibição</strong>, não os valores armazenados.</li>\n<li><code>sns.set_context</code> aumenta fontes e linhas para apresentações (<code>'notebook'</code> &lt; <code>'talk'</code> &lt; <code>'poster'</code>).</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_option</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">display.max_columns</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-kw\">None</span>)           <span class=\"tk-com\"># mostra todas as colunas</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_option</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">display.max_rows</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">100</span>)               <span class=\"tk-com\"># limite de linhas exibidas</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_option</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">display.float_format</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{:,.2f}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>.format)  <span class=\"tk-com\"># 2 casas decimais e separador de milhar</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_theme</span>(style=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">whitegrid</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, context=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">notebook</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, palette=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">deep</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">plt.rcParams[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">figure.figsize</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = (<span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">5</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-1-3\">1.3 Parâmetros do projeto</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> centraliza caminhos e parâmetros em um único lugar.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> quando a mesma análise é refeita periodicamente (por exemplo, todo mês ou todo ano). Basta alterar os parâmetros e rodar o notebook de novo.</p>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Atenção</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p>Evite caminhos absolutos da sua máquina espalhados pelo código. Prefira caminhos relativos à pasta do projeto.</p></div></aside>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">USAR_DADOS_EXEMPLO = <span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>                <span class=\"tk-com\"># False -&gt; usa o arquivo real abaixo</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">PERIODO = <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">aaaa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>                         <span class=\"tk-com\"># ex.: ano/mês de referência da análise</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">PASTA_DADOS = <span class=\"tk-fn\">Path</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">dados</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">PASTA_SAIDA = <span class=\"tk-fn\">Path</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">output</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">CAMINHO_DADOS = PASTA_DADOS / <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nome_do_arquivo.csv</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">CAMINHO_TABELA_CATEGORIAS = PASTA_DADOS / <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nome_da_tabela_de_categorias.csv</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">CAMINHO_EVENTOS = PASTA_DADOS / <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nome_da_tabela_de_eventos.csv</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">CAMINHO_SAIDA_TABELA = PASTA_SAIDA / <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tabela_</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>PERIODO<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.xlsx</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">CAMINHO_SAIDA_GRAFICO = PASTA_SAIDA / <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">grafico_</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>PERIODO<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.png</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">ALFA = <span class=\"tk-num\">0.05</span>                              <span class=\"tk-com\"># nível de significância dos testes (Seção 12)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">SEED = <span class=\"tk-num\">42</span>                                <span class=\"tk-com\"># semente para resultados reprodutíveis</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-1-4\">1.4 Datasets sintéticos de exemplo</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> gera dados <strong>fictícios e aleatórios</strong> com os mesmos tipos de coluna do template, para que todas as células deste notebook possam ser executadas e testadas.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> apenas para estudar ou testar o template. Em um projeto real, defina <code>USAR_DADOS_EXEMPLO = False</code>.</p>\n<p>Os dados incluem, de propósito, alguns problemas típicos: nulos, duplicados, números em formato de texto, outliers e assimetria. Além da tabela principal (<code>df</code>), são geradas uma tabela de dimensão (<code>tabela_categorias</code>) e uma tabela de eventos de clientes (<code>eventos</code>), usadas em SQL, junções, métricas de negócio e testes A/B.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">gerar_dados_exemplo</span>(n=<span class=\"tk-num\">1000</span>, seed=SEED):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Gera um DataFrame fictício com os tipos de coluna usados no template.</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    rng = np.random.<span class=\"tk-fn\">default_rng</span>(seed)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">    cat = rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">choice</span>([<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">A</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">B</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">C</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>], size=n, p=[<span class=\"tk-num\">0.5</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">0.3</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">0.2</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">    efeito_cat = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">Series</span>(cat).<span class=\"tk-fn\">map</span>({<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">A</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">0.0</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">B</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">0.25</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">C</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">0.5</span>}).<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_numpy</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">    num = np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">round</span>(rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">lognormal</span>(mean=<span class=\"tk-num\">2.0</span> + efeito_cat, sigma=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.6</span>, size=n), <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>)  <span class=\"tk-com\"># assimétrica à direita</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">    num_2 = np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">round</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">50</span> + <span class=\"tk-num\">4</span> * num + rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">normal</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">15</span>, n), <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>)                   <span class=\"tk-com\"># relação linear com num</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">    num_2[rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">choice</span>(n, <span class=\"tk-num\">8</span>, replace=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)] *= <span class=\"tk-num\">6</span>                                <span class=\"tk-com\"># outliers artificiais</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">    binaria = (rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">random</span>(n) &lt; <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span> / (<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span> + np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">exp</span>(-(num_2 - <span class=\"tk-num\">160</span>) / <span class=\"tk-num\">40</span>))).<span class=\"tk-fn\">astype</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">int</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">    data = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">Timestamp</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">2024-01-01</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>) + pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_timedelta</span>(rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">integers</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">365</span>, n), unit=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">D</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">    duracao = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_timedelta</span>(rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">integers</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">15</span>, n), unit=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">D</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">    valores = rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">uniform</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">5000</span>, n)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">    itens = [<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">item_1</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">item_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">item_3</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">item_4</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">    df = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>({</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">arange</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>, n + <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: cat,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">choice</span>([<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">X</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Y</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>], size=n),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_ordinal</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">choice</span>([<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">baixo</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">médio</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">alto</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>], size=n, p=[<span class=\"tk-num\">0.3</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">0.45</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">0.25</span>]),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_binaria</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: binaria,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"23\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: num,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"24\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: num_2,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"25\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_valor_texto</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: [<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>v<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,.2f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>.<span class=\"tk-fn\">replace</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">replace</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">replace</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>) <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> v <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> valores],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"26\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: data.<span class=\"tk-fn\">strftime</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%d</span><span class=\"tk-str\">/</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">m/</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Y</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"27\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data_fim</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: (data + duracao).<span class=\"tk-fn\">strftime</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%d</span><span class=\"tk-str\">/</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">m/</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Y</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"28\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_multivalor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: [<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">;</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>.<span class=\"tk-fn\">join</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">sorted</span>(rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">choice</span>(itens, rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">integers</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>), replace=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>))) <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> _ <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"tk-bi\">range</span>(n)],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"29\">    })</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"30\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Problemas típicos de dados reais</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"31\">    df.loc[rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">choice</span>(n, <span class=\"tk-num\">50</span>, replace=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>), <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = np.nan</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"32\">    df.loc[rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">choice</span>(n, <span class=\"tk-num\">30</span>, replace=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>), <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = np.nan</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"33\">    df.loc[rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">choice</span>(n, <span class=\"tk-num\">20</span>, replace=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>), <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_multivalor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = np.nan</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"34\">    df = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">concat</span>([df, df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">sample</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">5</span>, random_state=seed)], ignore_index=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)  <span class=\"tk-com\"># linhas duplicadas</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"35\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> df</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">gerar_tabelas_auxiliares</span>(n_clientes=<span class=\"tk-num\">3000</span>, seed=SEED):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Gera uma tabela de dimensão por categoria e uma tabela de eventos de clientes (funil + pedidos).</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    rng = np.random.<span class=\"tk-fn\">default_rng</span>(seed)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># 'D' não existe em df e 'Não informado' não existe aqui: isso torna visíveis os tipos de junção (Seção 4.10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">    tabela_categorias = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>({</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: [<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">A</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">B</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">C</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">D</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_grupo</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: [<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">grupo_1</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">grupo_1</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">grupo_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">grupo_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_meta</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: [<span class=\"tk-num\">1_200_000</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">700_000</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">450_000</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">100_000</span>],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">    })</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">    fim = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">Timestamp</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">2024-12-31</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">    taxa_conversao = {<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">controle</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">0.30</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tratamento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">0.36</span>}   <span class=\"tk-com\"># o 'tratamento' converte mais (teste A/B, Seção 12.8)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">    linhas = []</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> cliente <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"tk-bi\">range</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>, n_clientes + <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">        variante = <span class=\"tk-bi\">str</span>(rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">choice</span>([<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">controle</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tratamento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">        data = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">Timestamp</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">2023-01-01</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>) + pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">Timedelta</span>(days=<span class=\"tk-bi\">int</span>(rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">integers</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">700</span>)))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">        linhas.<span class=\"tk-fn\">append</span>((cliente, variante, data, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_1</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, np.nan))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">        <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">random</span>() &lt; <span class=\"tk-num\">0.6</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">            data += pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">Timedelta</span>(days=<span class=\"tk-bi\">int</span>(rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">integers</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">5</span>)))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">            linhas.<span class=\"tk-fn\">append</span>((cliente, variante, data, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, np.nan))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\">            <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">random</span>() &lt; taxa_conversao[variante] / <span class=\"tk-num\">0.6</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"23\">                data += pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">Timedelta</span>(days=<span class=\"tk-bi\">int</span>(rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">integers</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>)))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"24\">                <span class=\"tk-kw\">while</span> data &lt;= fim:                                   <span class=\"tk-com\"># pedidos recorrentes (retenção)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"25\">                    linhas.<span class=\"tk-fn\">append</span>((cliente, variante, data, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_3</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-bi\">round</span>(rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">lognormal</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">5</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">0.5</span>), <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>)))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"26\">                    <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">random</span>() &gt; <span class=\"tk-num\">0.65</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"27\">                        <span class=\"tk-kw\">break</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"28\">                    data += pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">Timedelta</span>(days=<span class=\"tk-bi\">int</span>(rng.<span class=\"tk-fn\">integers</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">25</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">40</span>)))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"29\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"30\">    eventos = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>(linhas, columns=[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id_cliente</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_variante</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data_evento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"31\">                                            <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_etapa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_valor_pedido</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"32\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> tabela_categorias, eventos</span></code></pre></div>",
